---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service | ImageLab"
  description="Terms of Service for using ImageLab's free browser-based image and PDF processing tools."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 space-y-8 animate-fade-up">
    <header>
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-2">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-zinc-950">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-2">Last updated: November 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="studio-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6 text-sm text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">1. Free Use of Tools</h2>
        <p>
          ImageLab provides free, client-side image and PDF utilities for personal and commercial
          use. By using this website, you agree to these terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">2. Your Content & Ownership</h2>
        <p>
          You retain 100% ownership and copyright over all images and PDFs you process with
          ImageLab. Because processing happens locally on your device, you are solely responsible
          for ensuring you have the right to edit or convert the files you select.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">3. No Warranty</h2>
        <p>
          All tools—including preset dimensions for job portals, exams, and passports—are provided
          "as is" without warranty of any kind. Always verify output dimensions, file size, and
          visual quality against your target circular or portal requirements before submitting.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-zinc-950">4. Open-Source Components</h2>
        <p>
          ImageLab incorporates open-source WebAssembly codecs and AI libraries. Full attributions
          and source repository links are listed on our <a href="/about" class="text-blue-600 font-semibold hover:underline">About page</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
